	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「仮面ライダーBLACK」がFigure-rise Standardで登場！",
			"• 膝関節は、ふくらはぎと太ももが接触するまで可動。劇中をイメージした迫力のあるアクションポーズが決まる。",
			"• 特徴的な「赤」「黄」のラインと胸のパーツなどのディテールはパーツ分割により表現。",
			"• ツヤありの鏡面仕上げによる光沢表現や、シルバー部分のエクストラフィニッシュなど、パーツごとの質感の違いを徹底追及。",
			"• さまざまなアクションシーンに対応できるよう、表情豊かなハンドパーツ左右各５種とジョイントパーツが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"MASKED RIDER BLACK\" is now available in Figure-rise Standard!",
			"• The knee joint is movable until the calf and thigh are in contact. A powerful action pose inspired by the play is decided.",
			"• Details such as the characteristic \"red\" and \"yellow\" lines and chest parts are expressed by dividing the parts.",
			"• Thorough pursuit of differences in texture for each part, such as glossy expression with a glossy mirror finish and extra finish of the silver part.",
			"• In order to respond to various action scenes, 5 types of expressive hand parts left and right and joint parts are included."
		]
	},
